      "subsection": "Hardware Compatibility",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "The range of ATI/AMD Catalyst 9.12 Drivers which are being rejected as incompatible has been fixed."
    },
    {
      "category": "COMBINED",
      "subsection": "Hardware Compatibility",
      "archetype": "",
      "powerset": "",
      "power": "",
      "text": "The '-ignoreBadDriver' command line argument can be added in the NCLauncher Preferences in order to load the game after this warning is displayed."
    },
